        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix: preserve tools when local-model lean agents use provider overrides",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where users running an agent with `experimental.localModelLean=true` could lose the expected tool surface when overriding that agent to a non-local provider model.\n\nIn the observed failure, a fresh `main` session using `meta/muse-spark-1.1` returned `Tool exec not found`. The same fresh session worked after disabling `main.experimental.localModelLean`, which isolated the failure to local-model lean being applied outside its intended scope.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n`localModelLean` is intended for local coding-model runs. It was being resolved from agent/session config alone, so a non-local provider override could inherit local-model-specific tool filtering and Tool Search defaults.\n\nThis change makes local-model lean model-aware. It keeps the existing behavior for local model providers such as Ollama and llama.cpp, while preventing lean mode from applying to non-local provider overrides when runtime model context is available.\n\nThis does not change configured tool policy, session authorization, or static provider catalog metadata handling.\n\n## User Impact\n\nUsers can keep `experimental.localModelLean=true` on local-model-oriented agents without accidentally applying that lean tool surface to cloud/provider overrides.\n\nLocal-model optimization remains available for local providers, while non-local providers keep their expected direct tool surface.\n\n## Evidence\n\nBefore this patch:\n- `main.experimental.localModelLean=true`\n- fresh `main` session\n- model override: `meta/muse-spark-1.1`\n- result: `Tool exec not found`\n\nRuntime isolation check:\n- Setting `main.experimental.localModelLean=false` and restarting the gateway made the same fresh `main` + Meta smoke succeed.\n- Exact observed output: `main-meta-fixed-tool-ok`\n\nFocused local validation after this patch:\n- `node_modules/.bin/oxfmt --write src/agents/local-model-lean.ts src/agents/agent-tools.ts src/agents/embedded-agent-runner/run/attempt.ts src/agents/local-model-lean.test.ts`\n- `node_modules/.bin/oxlint src/agents/local-model-lean.ts src/agents/agent-tools.ts src/agents/embedded-agent-runner/run/attempt.ts src/agents/local-model-lean.test.ts`\n- `node scripts/test-projects.mjs src/agents/local-model-lean.test.ts src/agents/embedded-agent-runner/run/attempt-tool-construction-plan.test.ts`\n\nFocused test result:\n- Test Files: 2 passed\n- Tests: 39 passed\n\nRegression coverage added:\n- non-local provider override does not enable lean mode\n- local provider selection still enables lean mode\n- non-local provider override does not inject lean Tool Search defaults\n\nScope note:\n- This is separate from PR #103051, which is limited to static provider catalog metadata propagation.\n",
        "branch": "fix/local-model-lean-provider-scope",
